#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:4 bcdf69b3c8c148e0a2dd1dbaec9b9120
msgid "Storage architecture"
msgstr "存储架构"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:6 73b58bd57a824a92a02edc1144c05c50
msgid ""
"The Storage class is responsible for managing the entire storage system, "
"which consists of two layers of storage engines: the upper layer is the "
"Engine, and the lower layer is the RawEngine. Engine and RawEngine are "
"abstract interface classes that can have multiple implementations, such as "
"RocksEngine, RaftKvEngine, MemEngine, etc."
msgstr ""
"存储类负责管理整个存储系统，该系统由两层存储引擎组成：上层是 Engine，下层是 "
"RawEngine。 Engine 和 RawEngine 都是抽象接口类，可以有多个实现，如 "
"RocksEngine、RaftKvEngine、MemEngine 等。"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:8 fa717531f7a848368032a2f3aed53fef
msgid ""
"RawEngine is the underlying engine, acting as a wrapper, and can also have "
"multiple implementations. Engine can contain RawEngine internally."
msgstr ""
"RawEngine 是底层引擎，充当封装器，也可以有多个实现。 引擎内部可以包含 "
"RawEngine。"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:10 87faad3fd80b465394ec2987c769b23e
msgid ""
"RaftKvEngine is a distributed storage engine based on Raft and is used in "
"production environments."
msgstr "RaftKvEngine 是基于 Raft 的分布式存储引擎，用于生产环境。"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:11 c4942760f561479f970227e68b7160c0
msgid ""
"RocksEngine is a single-node storage engine with a single replica, which can "
"be used in both production and testing environments."
msgstr ""
"RocksEngine 是一个具有单一副本的单节点存储引擎，既可用于生产环境，也可用于测"
"试环境。"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:12 27dbbb5803614d7085389e0d0eeba57c
msgid "MemEngine is a memory-based storage engine mainly used for testing."
msgstr "MemEngine 是一个基于内存的存储引擎，主要用于测试。"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:13 ecc25e873d0c4a0d83a9d1295aee9f81
msgid ""
"RawRocksEngine is a direct wrapper of RocksDB, encapsulating the "
"implementation details of RocksDB and providing easy-to-use interfaces to "
"the upper layer."
msgstr ""
"RawRocksEngine 是 RocksDB 的直接封装器，封装了 RocksDB 的实现细节，并为上层提"
"供了易于使用的接口。"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:15 00a2233c3b754147ab40d6e627a254a9
msgid "2. Storage Process"
msgstr "2.存储流程"

#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:17 620fa1ace15a4ca1974d3b93865de056
msgid ""
"Using Key/Value memory storage, since Key/Value is a binary byte array, it "
"is not very appropriate to store it directly with std::string. You can use "
"RocksDB's Slice class to represent it, which can reduce data copying during "
"data transfer."
msgstr ""
"这里使用Key/Value内存存储，由于Key/Value是一个二进制字节数组，因此直接用"
"std::string存储不是很合适。您可以使用RocksDB的Slice类来表示它，这可以减少数据"
"传输过程中的数据复制。"

