#: ../../source/architecture/store.md:59 ae11a8bf358e456bb0aab8b45806b896
msgid ""
"Region should have two states, one is the state of the Peer corresponding to "
"the Region (Region-Peer-State), and the other is the state of the Region "
"(Region-State). Region-State is maintained by Coordinator, and Region-Peer-"
"State is maintained by Store."
msgstr ""
"Region 应该有两个状态，一个是与Region 相对应的 Peer 的状态（Region-Peer-"
"State），另一个是Region 的状态（Region-State）。 Region-State 由 Coordinator "
"维护，Region-Peer-State 由 Store 维护。"

